                          "heading":  "The Outcome",
                          "text":  "Colchester Borough Council refused the original application in January 2020 (ref. 192805), citing overlooking of 12 Manor Close and an overbearing impact on the streetscene given the property\u0027s constrained plot. Architecture ONE prepared a revised resubmission in response."
